key":"Posts:","value":"302"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-20T00:34:28-07:00","id":175034,"title":"","content":"And the Coalition is REALLY upset that putting human genes into their drones doesn't give them a functioning node or quantum powers. Must be something else going on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2464,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2464-lustral_star","user":"lustral_star","date":". 06-20-2014, 02:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2464-lustral_star","name":"lustral_star","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2464_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"302"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-23T03:23:07-07:00","id":177801,"title":"","content":"From the existing material, there's no canon on Roswell or Area 51 unless it's called out specifically in one of the books' timelines.* Go nuts on whatever works best for your game. <br /> <br /> For the new stuff being worked on? Well, depends on how devious Ian and the rest want to get, I suppose\u2026<br /> <br /> <br /> Bates<br /> <br /> *And I don't believe there is\u2014but, then, it's been <i>years</i> since I looked at that stuff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2959-bates","name":"Bates","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2959_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-23T10:21:21-07:00","id":178054,"title":"","content":"The only reference to 1947 I have written down is one from <b>Aberrant: Elites</b>: <i>When the former British Empire pulls out of Asia, Pakistan and India immediately go to war over Kashmir, the region between the two countries.</i><br /> <br /> So unless I've missed something, I don't think there are references to Roswell and/or Area 51.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-23T11:18:26-07:00","id":178090,"title":"","content":"Hammersmith scared them all off on accident.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2464-lustral_star","name":"lustral_star","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2464_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"302"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T02:05:38-07:00","id":179547,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/174780-aliens?p=178054#post178054\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u2026<i>Pakistan and India immediately go to war over Kashmir, the region between the two countries.</i></div> </div> </div> </div>Glad that last bit was included. Would've been weird for them to fight over a Led Zeppelin song.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2959-bates","name":"Bates","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2959_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T07:10:42-07:00","id":179688,"title":"","content":"Or a sweater. But it's a REALLY NICE sweater...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2464-lustral_star","name":"lustral_star","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2464_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"302"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-12T12:37:43-07:00","id":195661,"title":"","content":"There were also large, floating creatures that live in gas giants... they were nicknamed Zepps, and while they haven't been encountered, humanity has found technology they left behind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3453-nephandi","name":"Nephandi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3453_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-12T18:26:25-07:00","id":195896,"title":"","content":"Really? We never encountered them? I could have sworn there was a first person mention of them -- but I haven't scoured the Trinity books like