t and Wonder.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2464-lustral_star","name":"lustral_star","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2464_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"302"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-14T19:21:48-07:00","id":197326,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lustral_star</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/174780-aliens?p=179688#post179688\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Or a sweater. But it's a REALLY NICE sweater...</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe a REALLY NICE sweater autographed by Led Zeppelin, with the original lyrics for the song written all over it?<br /> Some people WOULD go to war over such a thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-14T19:38:58-07:00","id":197331,"title":"","content":"I'm sure they would. There are lots of silly reasons people would go to war -- which is precisely why I'd just leave with the Novas and ship out to Eden on our Magical Intergalactic Spaceboat of Light and Wonder. And we would all get a free eufiber sweater.<br /> <br /> MISOLAW? Not a terribly bad acronym; better than most in sci-fi future settings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2464-lustral_star","name":"lustral_star","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2464_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"302"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T23:44:01-07:00","id":199717,"title":"","content":"There were also the natives of the planet Erebus, in Alien Encounter: Deception. They were at the mud hut level of tech, before they were all tortured, raped, and killed by the Coalition. I think Asia: Ascendant established that the Erebans were an uplift experiment by an Aberrant who had been allied at one time with Nippon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3453-nephandi","name":"Nephandi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3453_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T22:26:55-07:00","id":200749,"title":"","content":"There's also the whole thing about strange places and lost lands discovered after the Hammersmith Incident referenced in Adventure, that could be intersection areas with other periods or others worlds with equal ease.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-07T10:46:38-08:00","id":333211,"title":"","content":"I would have loved a throwaway line in the meta-plot history about a seperate alien species (possibly more humanlike than any in Trinity) visiting earth during either the adventure or aberrant ages - only to never be fully explained and for the incident to be investigated fruitlessly all the way into the age of Trinity. Probably not healthy for the meta-plot, but it just seems like it could belong in those genres just as much as in the space-faring conclusion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4458-nihilist","name":"Nihilist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4458_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-22T09:16:51-08:00","id":347471,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nihilist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/174780-aliens?p=333211#post333211\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would have loved a throwaway line in the meta-plot history about a seperate alien species (possibly more humanlike than any in Trinity) visiting earth during either the adventure or aberrant ages - only to never be fully explained and for the incident to be investigated fruitlessly all the way into the age of Trinity. Probably not healthy for the meta-plot, but it just seems like it could belong in those genres just as much as in the space-faring conclusion.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, the PG had a bunch of stuff on discussions, theories and documentaries discussing the possible manifestation of Novas in other eras and conditions and its potential connection to a number of medieval or ancient myths. To go from there into ancient astronauts &amp; such ain't a big jump...<br /> <br /> And one i sure did it in at least one chronicle, with Novas being an uplift/bioweaponry project made as weapon of last resort by a cabal of alien refugees against the ancient enemies they had been hiding themselves for millenia from.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 12-29-2014, 08:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-05T07:25:13-08:00","id":360197,"title":"","content":"coming back to the doyen, are there any books wich goes into more detail about them? in wich book did they first appear?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/24.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/619-deadguy","name":"DeadGuy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar619_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T01:34:25-08:00","id":361083,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/174780-aliens?p=347471#post347471\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, the PG had a bunch of stuff on discussions, theories and documentaries discussing the possible manifestation of Novas in other eras and conditions and its potential connection to a number of medieval or ancient myths. To go from there into ancient astronauts &amp; such ain't a big jump...<br /> <br /> And one i sure did it in at least one chronicle, with Novas being an uplift/bioweaponry project made as weapon of last resort by a cabal of alien refugees against the ancient enemies they had been hiding themselves for millenia from.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is one of my favorite things about the setting - versatility.<br /> I have personally always run with the head-canon idea that the Hammersmith effect ran both forwards and backwards in time, to the benefit of those like safari Jack Tallon, the occult resurgence around the 1900's and the old gun-slinger whose name currently eludes me. But had limited distribution - i assumed around 200 years - making Process 418 suspiciously well timed. It does not take much to assume a similar event propogating the same effect 200 years earlier and being carried backwards through time relative to the original experiment that saw the creation of the Aeon society.<br /> <br /> To DeadGuy:<br /> I beleive the Doyen first appeared in the Darkness Revealed trilogy, but i would need to go through still packed boxes of books to be sure of that or to point out where, the appearance is easily denied or ignored on that occasion from (perhaps faulty) recollection. The most groundshaking appearance is in Alien Encounter: Invasion - where corroborating witnesses are available and perhaps even recorded footage, if anyone happens to be able to keep electronics working during the alien's manifestation.<br /> The most detail about them is short supplementary columns and well-conceived, but non-official sources. Their motives being fairly obscure (outside of limiting the spread of Taint) and suggestions of warring factions within the species.<br /> Anyone who has the information at their fingertips could probably provide better information and even corrections to any misunderstandings i have presented here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4458,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4458-nihilist","user":"Nihilist","date":".  Typos 01-06-2015, 04:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4458-nihilist","name":"Nihilist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4458_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"259"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}